// Intentionally not modeled as ordinary FK:
// - assigned_to_id/type is polymorphic (Employee or SalesPerson).
// - item_id/type on package and document item tables is dynamic/polymorphic.
// - reference_id/type on financial records is polymorphic.
// - project_members and ticket_users are many-to-many pivot tables.
// - framework morph tables and ticket data stored in JSON are omitted.
